WEBVTT

00:09:27.938 --> 00:09:30.733
It matters how the money is spent

00:09:30.733 --> 00:09:33.694
and who ends up
with the resulting surplus.

00:09:34.653 --> 00:09:39.158
Tax cuts that deliver huge windfalls
for those at the top

00:09:39.158 --> 00:09:42.202
without sparking
investment and opportunity

00:09:42.244 --> 00:09:44.288
for the rest of the population

00:09:44.330 --> 00:09:46.874
don't make good use of deficits.

00:09:47.958 --> 00:09:49.627
On the other hand,

00:09:49.668 --> 00:09:54.340
spending trillions to support
the economy during the pandemic

00:09:54.381 --> 00:09:56.300
put the deficit to good use.

00:09:57.217 --> 00:10:01.639
We just had the shortest
recession in US history.